    "text": "By WBBJ Staff ,\n8 hours ago JACKSON, Tenn. (WBBJ) -Madison County Fire Department is currently on scene of a motor vehicle accident on Interstate 40 westbound at mile marker 92.6. Motorists should expect significant traffic delays in the area. At this time, traffic has been reduced to one lane while emergency personnel work to manage the scene safely. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
